  "description": {
   "en": "A female college student, Himesaki Toko, suddenly finds herself living next door to a new neighbor — Hon, an exchange student who also happens to be a dragon person.\n\nDespite her divine appearance, Hon is clumsy and absent-minded, and Toko just can’t bring herself to ignore her.\n\nThus begins a laid-back fantasy comedy about cross-cultural exchange, set in a student dorm!",
   "ja": "女子大生・姫崎塔子のおとなりに、竜人の留学生・ホンさんが越してきた。\n見た目の神々しさとは裏腹に、そそっかしくてうっかり屋なホンさんと、放っておけない塔子ちゃん。\n学生寮でゆるっと始まる、ファンタジー異文化交流コメディー！"
  },
